# Transformers and the Electric Utility System

**Authors:** Roman, Harry T.

## Abstract
For electric energy to get from the generating station to a home, it must pass through a transformer, a device that can change voltage levels easily. This article describes how transformers work, covering the following topics: (1) the magnetism-electricity link; (2) transformer basics; (3) the energy seesaw; (4) the turns ratio rule; and (5) transformers in action.

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ769547

